start: mr
R1: 3ch=dc {9dc}@ring ss@top
R2: C2@{2ch=hdc [2hdc@st]x9 hdc ss@top} # the last hdc goes into the stitch at the base of the beginning ch-2
R3: C2@{[ss {dc tr}@st 3tr@st {tr dc}@st]x5 ss@top}
R4: C3@{ch hdc 2dc tr 2dc hdc [sc hdc 2dc tr 2dc hdc]x4 ss@top}
R5: C3@{4ch=tr ch tr@same 2dc@st dc hdc 3sc [hdc dc 2dc@st {tr ch tr}@st 2dc@st dc hdc 3sc]x3 hdc dc 2dc@st ss@top fo}
